                "description": "Uploads versioning is enabled and enforced by the versioning policy gate, retaining prior object versions to support recovery. Lambda reserved concurrency is 10. Its encrypted SQS dead-letter queue retains failed asynchronous events for 14 days. API Gateway invokes Lambda synchronously, so those request failures do not use this queue. A complete contingency plan, restore testing, failure-path exercises, and dedicated GAP-06 policies are not claimed.",
