                "control-id": "hipaa-164-312-a-1",
                "description": "The Lambda data-access policy permits only dynamodb:PutItem on the submissions table and s3:PutObject under the uploads/ prefix. Supporting KMS permissions are scoped by key, service, and encryption context. The least-privilege gate checks inline and supporting documents, embedded policies, alternate attachments, and unresolved identities or policy JSON. This covers runtime software authorization; patient authentication and session controls are outside this implementation.",
