              {
                "uuid": "cb95f1f9-8861-446f-b462-0a878f598335",
                "control-id": "hipaa-164-312-b",
                "description": "The API stage records request metadata in a CloudWatch log group with 90-day retention. Lambda logs also have 90-day retention, and Lambda/API stage tracing is enabled. Execution logging and data tracing are disabled to avoid recording request bodies. API throttling, metrics, and WAF provide supporting protections. Multi-region CloudTrail captures management events with log-file validation; data-event coverage is not claimed. Pipeline evidence is signed through GitHub OIDC and stored in a versioned, KMS-encrypted vault with GOVERNANCE Object Lock. Dedicated audit regression policies, scheduled detection, and telemetry exercises remain backlog work.",
